{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_036_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:71b3eaf6a3b5d21d4395de0aa2fb65f17428c568270091d57371d480bfd6653e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_d:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1282fb0749cbac924d5553215a79a50c04358bee7dca4290c1928ab6a6e2d717",
      "text": "（……对我来说就算只是平平无奇的东西，\n对类先生来说也全都是特别的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_d:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:710b0ab8fe437affe09b35405d647d033267fbe36ff61b057d858ff21b33f43c",
      "text": "（这里有太多他的回忆了。\n这个房间，正是舞田类这位偶像本身）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_d:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2b6687e84f29a084648b5a85a5da3d43b3d076ca480056bf1f20bae6a1cc919",
      "text": "（去改变这一切，\n说不定反而是一种错误……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_d:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:548c1e79e3a90f6d6581fdd326a51de6fbe6c11421fd129934286b8e6c60dad5",
      "text": "类先生，不好意思。\n这次的节目播出，果然还是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_d:cmd-000045:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2a40248a047b34eca4002dcdf855823097e67ae97e2d83de4a83373b48f972a",
      "text": "数周后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84938e01bd9f4ab45e32959e4342fa984950ec3bebc8ded5e6fca3334665e16a",
      "text": "啊……终于开播了呢，\n《偶像的住宅访问！》",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_d:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1122298ed3de732fafe243e5a92ceba173c139285a5844d43fb9db9b998a6373",
      "text": "是之前录制的那期节目呢！\n演播室里的大家当时好像都被我的房间吓到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a295fcd89536e6600d1a1e09b251a2d46a0f6034f0f34e8807012e83e0aceb95",
      "text": "是啊。不过大家都表示很能理解呢。\n说这充分体现了类先生的性格。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_d:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40dbe6a5ee7e715712f4d0e99f1de1321b373f61fb8d92901ed2139582b4f974",
      "text": "Yeah！东西堆得满满的，热热闹闹的，\n大家都夸这真是地地道道的“舞田Room”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_d:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1eb6adfa71375daf9b9cc1106b37e184d5f6e9f6c365729fc8f6cb2ae4b0506",
      "text": "毕竟是我看惯了的房间，\n我自己倒是没觉得有什么特别的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_d:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87c0da2ced0058c6152b6b44b684b7948b8a765bc2d8faf8bb0d2975bc7f317c",
      "text": "粉丝们会给出\n怎样的反应呢，好期待呀☆",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
